  "conclusion": "Fixed confidence partitions plus paid exact error compositions lose to original PAQ on all four prefixes. Enumerative frames are smaller than the same-constraint arithmetic control, largely through termination/length overhead. This does not establish a predictive information gain over arithmetic coding.",
